From 286c95a1c805a875511d2662961985140337e8fa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 07:46:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/18] lax/mso-transductions: proofs build at v4.33.0

Nine files: the Common.Aux import renamed, rw/simpa at def-wrapped
component types ((trans R).E, (toI T).Elt, (toSrcRel R).Idx) replaced by
the lemma applied term-level or given its arguments, constructor
injectivity through congrArg Prod.snd (Sum.inl.inj h), Function.id_def in
one simpa. No statement changed; concepts untouched.
